==============================================================================
DERIVED THRESHOLDS
==============================================================================
  Gamma_crit = nu_S / nu_C^max      = 50/10  = 5.0
  Gamma at comfortable human pace   = 50/3  = 16.7
  -> to hold 0.8 <= Gamma <= 1.2 at nu_C=10/s, throttle nu_S to [8, 12] tok/s
  -> autonomous agent loop (no carbon in loop): nu_C -> 0, Gamma -> infinity

  Both substrates sit at eps ~ 1e18-1e21 x Landauer, i.e. the SAME order.
  Gamma ~ 1 is therefore NOT fine-tuned: it is the natural operating point.
